"src/)                                                                                     "
"| StyleSheet-friendly token objects (no CSS variables).      |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/web-components`](/api/renderers/web-components/"
"src/)                                                                                 "
"| `<instui-icon>` and styled primitives, framework-agnostic. |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/astro`](/api/renderers/astro/"
"src/)                                                                                                   "
"| Token setup for Astro sites.                               |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/react-markdown`](/api/renderers/react-markdown/src/), "
"[`@pantoken/rehype`](/api/renderers/rehype/"
"src/)                               | Icon tokens and swatches in "
"Markdown.                      |\n"
"| [`@pantoken/markdown-it`](/api/renderers/markdown-it/"
